;; owner: L1. fib.core.num: the numeric functions (never `/` on integers: write `quot`, tranche 1 plan PC-14). Exports: inc dec abs mod max min zero? pos? neg? even? odd? compare Ratio numerator denominator; Div instances for i8 i16 i32 i64 f32 f64 (Ratio t); Num Eq Ord Hash for Ratio.
;; Until L1 writes it this part is its ns form alone (tranche 1 plan §4.2); the :use lines are the
;; facades above it and the parts of its own facade that P0 wrote. The owner replaces these three lines with the part's own header.
(ns fib.core.num (:use fib.core.base fib.core.protocols))
